utube.com/embed/tHAj5I2V_Uk","width":480,"height":360},"title":{"simpleText":"The 59 Minute Baseball Practice has been called the \"bible of youth baseball practices.\"  #baseball,"},"description":{"simpleText":"#SchupakSports, #baseballdrills, #baseballcoaching,\n\nWant to get an extra 1-2 runs per game? Check out Marty's Baserunning \u0026 Bunting Drills video at: https://tinyurl.com/bdeerts3\nThe baserunning drills and bunting strategies in this program will make your team better which will yield more wins! Guaranteed!  Learn why baserunning is the most underrated skill in baseball and softball. And why most coaches don't practice it! It's all in this video FREE!\n\nWant more great ideas? See Marty's latest episode on YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zZbW6JreJZs\nMarty covers: interference vs. obstruction, a creative 1st \u0026 3rd defensive strategy \u0026 a hitting drill to extend at bats. Classic trivia and more! \n\nLike Marty's videos? You'll love his newest book: \"Championship Baseball Drills\" with 115 creative drills, strategies and more: https://tinyurl.com/2p8tsdhc\n\nIf you liked Marty's sports content you'll love his other products! He is still producing products to make your son \u0026 daughter a better player. And make you a better coach and parent\n\nhttps://tballamerica.com/\nMarty Schupak has spent over 25 years coaching youth sports. His books \u0026 videos have been viewed by millions of coaches \u0026 parents around the world with many leagues making some of his products required viewing. Marty received his under graduate degree from Boston University. He received his Master's degree in Physical Education from Arizona State University. Many of his former players have gone on to play sports in college and beyond. He has a free blog \nT-Ball America (https://tballamerica.com/) that capturing the latest trends in youth sports addressing everything from t-ball to how to best get that fully paid athletic college scholarship. \n\nMarty Schupak has gone out of his way to make all his products available \nfor free or at a minimum cost. Please subscribe to this page and follow\nMarty at Twitter: @schupaksports\n\nMarty's most popular baseball book:\nBaseball Coaching: A Guide For The Youth Coach And Parent\nhttps://tinyurl.com/bf5bhb3r\n\nMarty's must read book for competitive baseball \u0026 softball coaches:\n44 Baseball Mistakes And Corrections\nhttps://tinyurl.com/kxmbx4xx\n\nMarty's T-Ball Skills \u0026 Drills (book)\nhttps://tinyurl.com/yeyyt4bp\n\nMarty's latest t-ball book:\nT-Ball Drills (over 100 creative drills)\nhttps://tinyurl.com/yc4shvys\n\nMarty's  popular hitting video viewed by MLB platers:Hitting Drills \u0026 Techniques\nhttps://tinyurl.com/pjf3wary\n\nMarty's popular basketball videos including the #1 viewed basketball video in the wold:\n48 Championship Basketball Drills\nhttps://tinyurl.com/mdkbzdkz\n\nMarty's soccer videos endorsed by leagues and organizations world wide:\nhttps://tinyurl.com/3d694wmt\n\nMarty's  preferred vendor for some of his products at Book Baby:\nhttps://tinyurl.com/5kbvs54w\n\nMarty's  Amazon page:\nhttps://tinyurl.com/brwj5wv3\n\nMarty's videos are available for free through your local library.\nThe programs are:\nHoopla, Overdrive, Kanopy\n\nSchupak Sports YouTube Channel Archives\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7T9Q...     \nMarty Schupak describes 3 drills \u0026 efficient balling practice. 20-30% more swings. For 8-12 yrs old\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QxHrb...\nMarty Schupak describes 7 drills especially for 8-12 years old with coaching tips you have to hear.\n\nMarty Schupak interviews hitting coach Bobby Woods, one of the country's best!\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZMNwp...\n\nNFL  fan? Maybe a NY Jets fan like Marty?\nCheck out his blog at Jets Rewind:\nhttps://jetsrewind.com/\n\n\"There are a lot more important things in life than baseball. \n  I just haven't found out what they are yet.\"\n                                          